WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: And a redirection.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Radio: Gate 7 route closed. Redirect to Gate 8 via outer concourse. Over.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:17.500
Narrator: Faisal reads it back, moves to where everyone can see him, and makes a short announcement.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Faisal: Gate 7 is closed. Please use Gate 8 - this way.

5
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Narrator: Noura repeats it at the next corner, so nobody is left guessing.

